  <lesson id="les-l3-10-gateway-fails" title="The gateway fails" level="3" minutes="12" goal="DeskPC cannot reach Server through 10.61.0.1. Make GatewayA and GatewayB share that address with VRRP."/>
  <step n="1" text="Ping Server from DeskPC. The PC's gateway 10.61.0.1 does not exist yet, so the ping fails."/>
  <step n="2" text="On GatewayA, interface GigabitEthernet0/0: vrrp 1 ip 10.61.0.1 priority 120."/>
  <step n="3" text="On GatewayB, the same interface: vrrp 1 ip 10.61.0.1 priority 100."/>
  <step n="4" text="Ping again. Power GatewayA off and ping once more: GatewayB takes over without touching the PC."/>
  <check id="c1" kind="ping" from="pc0" to="server0" url="" expect="ok" label="DeskPC reaches Server through the virtual gateway"/>
